<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Adaptive-icon foreground layer: the Dead-Fest skull in a warm white-to-ember gradient.

    Scaled to 0.82 and centred so the mark sits inside the 72x72dp adaptive safe zone, meaning
    no launcher mask (circle, squircle, rounded square) can ever clip it.

    Deliberately contains *only* the skull: the system derives the themed (monochrome) icon from
    this layer's alpha, so any decorative glow here would show up as a grey disc in themed mode.
-->
